## Documentation-as-Service

- Create professional-grade documentation for clients:
  - Implement consistent branding across all documentation
  - Develop templates for different document types
  - Establish quality metrics for documentation deliverables
  - Create visually appealing layouts and formatting
  - Incorporate information design best practices

- Documentation export formats:
  - PDF with professional formatting
  - Interactive HTML for digital delivery
  - Print-optimized versions for physical distribution
  - Markdown source files for future updates

## Philosophical Alignment

As Communicate (U6) department, focus on:
- Clear and effective communication
- Authentic representation of values
- Engaging and compelling storytelling
- Building genuine connections
- Transparent and ethical marketing practices
- Extending the Dreamflo philosophy to clients

